}

docs {
  Changes the type or the level of a resource (#1246). Both fields are optional. The curator, or a member who manages the spaces of the community. A type chosen here stays when the page is captured again (type_chosen). Only articles keep captured content: another type removes the server capture. Token ability: resources:write.
}
